<templates xml:space="preserve">
<t t-name="meli_optimization.Workbench">
<div class="meli-workbench" t-att-aria-busy="state.loading">
  <aside class="mw-sidebar" aria-label="运营导航">
    <div class="mw-brand"><span class="mw-logo">M</span><span>Mercado 运营中心<small>OPTIMIZATION WORKSPACE</small></span></div>
    <div class="mw-nav-caption">运营管理</div>
    <button t-att-class="state.section === 'cases' ? 'active' : ''" t-on-click="() => this.navigate('cases')"><i class="fa fa-th-large"/>商品优化</button>
    <button t-att-class="state.section === 'batches' ? 'active' : ''" t-on-click="() => this.navigate('batches')"><i class="fa fa-folder-open-o"/>优化批次</button>
    <button t-att-class="state.section === 'collections' ? 'active' : ''" t-on-click="() => this.navigate('collections')"><i class="fa fa-search"/>独立爆款采集</button>
    <button t-att-class="state.section === 'library' ? 'active' : ''" t-on-click="() => this.navigate('library')"><i class="fa fa-picture-o"/>公司图片库</button>
    <div class="mw-sidebar-note"><i class="fa fa-shield"/>公司范围内的真实业务记录<br/>确认方案后另行接入平台执行</div>
  </aside>
  <div class="mw-shell">
    <header class="mw-topbar"><strong>链接优化工作台</strong><div class="mw-scope"><span><i class="fa fa-building-o"/> <t t-esc="state.data?.company || '公司'"/></span><span>Mercado Libre</span><span>站点范围由下方筛选</span></div><button class="mw-button" t-on-click="refresh" t-att-disabled="state.loading"><i class="fa fa-refresh"/> 刷新</button></header>
    <main class="mw-main">
      <div t-if="state.error" class="mw-error" role="alert"><strong>操作未完成</strong> <t t-esc="state.error"/><button t-on-click="refresh">重试</button></div>
      <div t-if="state.loading" class="mw-loading" role="status">正在加载业务数据…</div>
      <t t-if="state.data">
      <div class="mw-heading"><div><div class="mw-eyebrow">运营管理 / <t t-esc="state.detail ? (state.detail.collection ? '独立采集详情' : '商品详情') : ({collections:'独立爆款采集',library:'公司图片库'})[state.section] || labels[state.section]"/></div><h1 t-esc="state.detail ? state.detail.name : ({collections:'独立爆款采集',library:'公司图片库'})[state.section] || '商品链接优化'"/><p>以商品快照为依据，研究、选择并确认每一次变更。</p></div><div class="mw-actions"><button t-if="state.detail" class="mw-button" t-on-click="back">返回列表</button><button t-if="state.data.can_edit and !['collections','library'].includes(state.section)" class="mw-button primary" t-on-click="createForm" t-att-disabled="state.loading">＋ 新建优化</button></div></div>
      <div t-if="!state.detail and ['cases','batches'].includes(state.section)" class="mw-stats"><t t-foreach="Object.keys(labels)" t-as="key" t-key="key"><div class="mw-card mw-stat"><span t-esc="labels[key]"/><strong t-esc="state.data.counts[key]"/><small>当前授权公司范围</small></div></t></div>
      <section t-if="!state.detail and state.section === 'collections'" class="mw-card">
        <div class="mw-card-heading"><h2>独立采集任务</h2><button t-if="state.data.can_edit" class="mw-button primary" t-on-click="collectionForm">＋ 新建独立采集</button></div>
        <p class="mw-note">先提供源服装描述、商品链接或参考图，再研究爆款与采集准确 SKU。无需建立待优化商品。外部研究与图片采集尚无内置在线 Provider；需要配置 Worker，缺失能力会显示等待原因。</p>
        <div t-if="!state.collections.length" class="mw-empty">暂无采集任务。采集完成且图片已归档后，可永久保存到公司图库。</div>
        <article class="mw-task" t-foreach="state.collections" t-as="row" t-key="row.id"><div><strong t-esc="row.name"/><small><t t-esc="row.snapshot.site_id"/> · <t t-esc="row.snapshot.garment"/></small></div><button class="mw-button" t-on-click="() => this.open(row.id)">打开采集任务 →</button></article>
      </section>
      <section t-if="!state.detail and state.section === 'library'" class="mw-card">
        <div class="mw-card-heading"><h2>公司图片库</h2><span><t t-esc="state.library.length"/> 个已归档图库</span></div>
        <form class="mw-filters" t-on-submit.prevent="filterLibrary"><input aria-label="图库商品搜索" placeholder="参考商品 ID" t-model="state.libraryQuery"/><input aria-label="图库站点筛选" placeholder="站点，如 MLM" t-model="state.librarySite"/><button class="mw-button primary">筛选图库</button></form>
        <p class="mw-note">图库跨商品保留原始 SKU、来源、采集时间与图片摘要。进入商品的「图片与质检」可选择换装目标；源服装另行提供。</p>
        <div t-if="!state.library.length" class="mw-empty">暂无已验证图片。请在采集任务的目标图库中保存已归档的结果。</div>
        <div class="mw-candidates"><article class="mw-candidate" t-foreach="state.library" t-as="entry" t-key="entry.id"><div class="mw-candidate-image"><img t-att-src="libraryImage(entry.payload.images[0])" alt="已归档图库封面"/></div><strong t-esc="entry.name"/><p><t t-esc="entry.site_id"/> · <t t-esc="entry.payload.images.length"/> 张 · <t t-esc="entry.payload.completeness_status === 'complete' ? '完整图库' : '部分图库'"/></p><p t-esc="entry.payload.observed_at"/><button class="mw-button" t-on-click="() => {state.librarySelection=entry;state.modal='library-detail';}">查看图片与来源</button></article></div>
      </section>
      <t t-if="!state.detail and ['cases','batches'].includes(state.section)">
        <section class="mw-card"><div class="mw-card-heading"><h2 t-esc="state.section === 'batches' ? '优化批次' : '商品流程'"/><span>共 <t t-esc="state.section === 'batches' ? state.data.batches.length : state.data.total"/> 条</span></div>
        <t t-if="state.section === 'batches'"><div t-if="!state.data.batches.length" class="mw-empty">暂无批次。新建优化时可创建首个批次。</div><button class="mw-batch" t-foreach="state.data.batches" t-as="batch" t-key="batch.id" t-on-click="() => this.openBatch(batch.id)"><i class="fa fa-folder-open-o"/><strong t-esc="batch.name"/><span>查看商品 →</span></button></t>
        <t t-else="">
        <form class="mw-filters" t-on-submit.prevent="filter"><input aria-label="搜索商品 ID 或原标题" placeholder="搜索商品 ID / 原标题" t-model="state.query"/><select aria-label="批次筛选" t-model.number="state.batch"><option value="">全部批次</option><option t-foreach="state.data.batches" t-as="batch" t-key="batch.id" t-att-value="batch.id" t-esc="batch.name"/></select><input aria-label="店铺筛选" placeholder="店铺名称（精确）" t-model="state.shop"/><input aria-label="站点筛选" placeholder="站点，如 MLM" t-model="state.site"/><select aria-label="任务状态筛选" t-model="state.status"><option value="">全部任务状态</option><option t-foreach="['queued','running','waiting','failed','succeeded','cancelled']" t-as="status" t-key="status" t-att-value="status" t-esc="label(status)"/></select><button class="mw-button primary" t-att-disabled="state.loading">查询</button></form>
        <div class="mw-table-scroll"><table class="mw-table"><thead><tr><th>商品信息</th><th>店铺 / 站点</th><th>批次</th><th>快照版本</th><th>任务进度</th><th>操作</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr t-foreach="state.data.rows" t-as="row" t-key="row.id"><td><div class="mw-product"><img t-if="safeUrl(row.product.image_url)" t-att-src="safeUrl(row.product.image_url)" alt="商品快照" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"/><div><strong t-esc="row.product.title || row.name"/><small t-esc="row.product.item_id || '商品身份未知'"/></div></div></td><td><t t-esc="row.product.shop || '未知'"/><small t-esc="row.product.site_id || '未知'"/></td><td t-esc="row.batch"/><td>v<t t-esc="row.revision"/></td><td><span class="mw-badge"><t t-esc="row.tasks"/> 任务</span><small>等待 <t t-esc="row.waiting"/> · 失败 <t t-esc="row.failed"/></small></td><td><button class="mw-link" t-on-click="() => this.open(row.id)">查看详情 →</button></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
        <div t-if="!state.data.rows.length" class="mw-empty"><i class="fa fa-inbox"/><h3>暂无匹配商品</h3><p>调整筛选条件，或新建商品优化并保存输入快照。</p></div>
        <div class="mw-pagination"><span>每页 20 条 · 共 <t t-esc="state.data.total"/> 条</span><button class="mw-button" t-on-click="() => this.page(-1)" t-att-disabled="state.page === 0 || state.loading">上一页</button><span t-esc="state.page + 1"/><button class="mw-button" t-on-click="() => this.page(1)" t-att-disabled="(state.page + 1) * 20 >= state.data.total || state.loading">下一页</button></div>
        </t></section>
      </t>
      <t t-if="state.detail">
        <section t-if="state.detail.collection" class="mw-card mw-collection-source"><div class="mw-card-heading"><h2>源服装与采集范围</h2><span t-esc="state.detail.snapshot.payload.site_id"/></div><p t-esc="state.detail.snapshot.payload.garment"/><a t-if="safeUrl(state.detail.snapshot.payload.source_url)" t-att-href="safeUrl(state.detail.snapshot.payload.source_url)" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">查看源服装链接 ↗</a><div class="mw-actions"><img t-foreach="state.detail.snapshot.payload.source_image_artifact_ids || []" t-as="ref" t-key="ref" t-att-src="libraryImage({artifact_id:ref})" alt="源服装参考图" style="width:100px;height:120px;object-fit:contain"/></div></section>
        <nav class="mw-tabs" aria-label="商品详情"><button t-foreach="state.detail.collection ? tabs.filter(t => ['tasks','research','gallery','audit'].includes(t[0])) : tabs" t-as="tab" t-key="tab[0]" t-att-class="state.tab === tab[0] ? 'active' : ''" t-on-click="() => {state.tab=tab[0];}" t-esc="tab[1]"/></nav>
        <section t-if="state.tab === 'snapshot'" class="mw-card"><div class="mw-card-heading"><h2>不可覆盖的商品快照 · v<t t-esc="state.detail.revision"/></h2><button t-if="state.data.can_edit" class="mw-button" t-on-click="snapshotForm">新增快照版本</button></div><t t-if="state.detail.snapshot"><div class="mw-snapshot"><img t-if="safeUrl(state.detail.snapshot.payload.image_url)" t-att-src="safeUrl(state.detail.snapshot.payload.image_url)" alt="商品快照图片" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"/><dl><t t-foreach="['shop','site_id','item_id','title','seller_sku','available_quantity','value_status','source']" t-as="field" t-key="field"><dt t-esc="({shop:'店铺',site_id:'站点',item_id:'商品 ID',title:'原标题',seller_sku:'SKU',available_quantity:'库存',value_status:'数据状态',source:'来源'})[field]"/><dd t-esc="value(state.detail.snapshot.payload[field])"/></t></dl></div><p class="mw-note">手动录入为运营观察，未经平台回读验证；缺失库存保留未知。新增版本会使旧方案确认失效。</p><details><summary>快照审计证据</summary><pre t-esc="json(state.detail.snapshot)"/></details></t><div t-else="" class="mw-empty">此流程尚无快照</div></section>
        <section t-elif="state.tab === 'facts'" class="mw-card mw-facts">
          <div class="mw-card-heading"><h2>商品事实</h2><span>当前快照 #<t t-esc="state.detail.snapshot?.id || '未知'"/></span></div>
          <p class="mw-note">展示已完成事实任务的来源观察；缺失字段保留未知。事实整理不推断材质或商品属性，也不代表实时平台库存。</p>
          <div t-if="factsView.status === 'no_snapshot'" class="mw-empty mw-facts-empty">此流程尚无商品快照，无法确定当前商品事实。</div>
          <div t-elif="factsView.status === 'missing'" class="mw-empty mw-facts-empty">当前快照暂无已完成的商品事实。请在任务队列创建「整理商品事实」，完成后刷新查看。</div>
          <div t-elif="factsView.status === 'stale'" class="mw-empty mw-facts-stale">当前快照暂无已完成事实；已有结果属于历史快照，不能作为当前商品事实。请整理当前快照后刷新。</div>
          <div t-if="factsView.current" class="mw-facts-current">
            <p class="mw-facts-meta">当前快照事实 · 最近完成任务 #<t t-esc="factsView.current.id"/> · 快照 #<t t-esc="factsView.current.snapshot_id"/></p>
            <t t-set="factsResult" t-value="factsView.current"/><t t-call="meli_optimization.FactsResult"/>
          </div>
          <details t-foreach="factsView.history" t-as="history" t-key="history.id" class="mw-facts-history">
            <summary>历史快照 #<t t-esc="history.snapshot_id"/> · 任务 #<t t-esc="history.id"/> · 仅供审计，非当前事实</summary>
            <t t-set="factsResult" t-value="history"/><t t-call="meli_optimization.FactsResult"/>
          </details>
        </section>
        <section t-elif="state.tab === 'tasks'" class="mw-card"><div class="mw-card-heading"><h2>任务队列</h2><button t-if="state.data.can_edit" class="mw-button primary" t-on-click="taskForm">＋ 创建任务</button></div><p class="mw-note">耗时任务由独立 Worker 执行。外部能力缺失时保留等待状态；未知外部请求需先核实。</p><div t-if="!state.detail.tasks.length" class="mw-empty">暂无任务。先创建「整理商品事实」任务。</div><article class="mw-task" t-foreach="state.detail.tasks" t-as="task" t-key="task.id"><div><strong t-esc="taskLabels[task.task_type] || task.task_type"/><small>#<t t-esc="task.id"/> · 快照 #<t t-esc="task.snapshot_id"/></small><p t-if="task.status_detail" t-esc="task.status_detail.message"/></div><span t-att-class="'mw-badge ' + task.state" t-esc="label(task.state)"/><div t-if="state.data.can_edit" class="mw-actions"><button t-if="task.state === 'succeeded' and task.snapshot_id === state.detail.snapshot.id and ['product.facts','research.keywords'].includes(task.task_type)" class="mw-button primary" t-on-click="() => this.archive(task)" t-att-disabled="state.loading">归档结果供后续任务使用</button><button t-if="['waiting','failed'].includes(task.state)" class="mw-button" t-on-click="() => this.control(task,'resume')" t-att-disabled="state.loading">恢复</button><button t-if="['queued','running','waiting','failed'].includes(task.state)" class="mw-button" t-on-click="() => this.control(task,'cancel')" t-att-disabled="state.loading">取消</button></div></article></section>
        <section t-elif="['titles','research','gallery','images'].includes(state.tab)" class="mw-card"><div class="mw-card-heading"><h2 t-esc="tabs.find(t => t[0] === state.tab)[1]"/><div class="mw-actions"><button t-if="state.data.can_edit and state.tab === 'images'" class="mw-button primary" t-on-click="selectLibrary">从公司图库选择换装目标</button><button t-if="state.data.can_edit" class="mw-button" t-on-click="taskForm">创建研究 / 生成任务</button></div></div><div t-if="!visibleTasks.length" class="mw-empty">暂无该分支任务或结果。创建对应任务后刷新查看。</div><article class="mw-result" t-foreach="visibleTasks" t-as="task" t-key="task.id"><div class="mw-card-heading"><strong><t t-esc="taskLabels[task.task_type]"/> #<t t-esc="task.id"/></strong><span t-att-class="'mw-badge ' + task.state" t-esc="label(task.state)"/></div><p t-if="task.snapshot_id !== state.detail.snapshot.id" class="mw-note">历史快照结果，仅供审计。创建当前快照任务以选择候选。</p><p t-if="task.status_detail" t-esc="task.status_detail.message"/><p t-if="task.result?.reason" t-esc="task.result.reason"/><p t-if="task.result?.uncertainties" t-esc="task.result.uncertainties.join('；')"/>
          <div class="mw-candidates"><article class="mw-candidate" t-foreach="rows(task.result)" t-as="row" t-key="row_index"><div t-if="imageUrl(row)" class="mw-candidate-image"><img t-att-src="imageUrl(row)" alt="候选商品或图片" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"/></div><strong t-esc="row.text || row.name || row.item_id || row.image_id"/><p t-if="'value' in row" t-esc="value(row.value)"/><t t-if="row.platform"><p><t t-esc="row.platform"/> · <t t-esc="row.item_id"/></p><p>销量展示：<t t-esc="value(row.sold_display)"/> · 评分：<t t-esc="value(row.rating)"/> · 广告：<t t-esc="value(row.is_ad)"/></p><p t-esc="row.selection_reason"/><a t-if="safeUrl(row.url)" t-att-href="safeUrl(row.url)" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">查看来源 ↗</a></t><p t-if="row.role"><t t-esc="row.role"/> · <t t-esc="row.width"/> × <t t-esc="row.height"/></p><p t-if="row.status" t-esc="row.status"/><label t-if="state.data.can_edit and selectable(task)" class="mw-choice"><input type="checkbox" t-att-checked="selected(task,row_index)" t-on-change="() => this.toggle(task,row_index)"/>选择此候选</label></article></div>
          <div t-if="state.selections[task.id]?.length" class="mw-selection"><strong>已选顺序</strong><div t-foreach="state.selections[task.id]" t-as="index" t-key="index"><span><t t-esc="index_index + 1"/>. <t t-esc="rows(task.result)[index].text || rows(task.result)[index].image_id || rows(task.result)[index].item_id"/></span><button class="mw-button" t-on-click="() => this.move(task,index_index,-1)" t-att-disabled="index_index === 0" aria-label="向前移动">↑</button><button class="mw-button" t-on-click="() => this.move(task,index_index,1)" t-att-disabled="index_last" aria-label="向后移动">↓</button></div><button class="mw-button primary" t-on-click="() => this.propose(task)" t-att-disabled="state.loading">生成确切方案预览</button></div>
          <button t-if="state.data.can_edit and task.task_type === 'gallery.collect' and selectable(task)" class="mw-button primary" t-on-click="() => this.importGallery(task)" t-att-disabled="state.loading">保存已验证图片到公司图库</button><details t-if="task.result"><summary>展开结果与审计证据</summary><pre t-esc="json(task.result)"/></details></article></section>
        <section t-elif="state.tab === 'proposals'" class="mw-card"><div class="mw-card-heading"><h2>变更方案与运营确认</h2></div><p class="mw-note">确认仅记录所见方案的摘要及输入版本。平台写入当前不可用，不会因确认触发发布。</p><div t-if="!state.detail.proposals.length" class="mw-empty">先在标题、爆款或图片结果中选择候选并生成预览。</div><article class="mw-task" t-foreach="state.detail.proposals" t-as="proposal" t-key="proposal.id"><div><strong>#<t t-esc="proposal.id"/> · <t t-esc="proposal.payload.action"/></strong><small t-esc="proposal.payload.scope"/></div><span class="mw-badge" t-esc="!proposal.current ? '输入已失效' : proposal.confirmed ? '已确认 · 未执行' : '待确认'"/><button class="mw-button" t-on-click="() => this.preview(proposal)">查看确切变更</button></article></section>
        <section t-elif="state.tab === 'activity' || state.tab === 'effects'" class="mw-card mw-empty"><i class="fa fa-plug"/><h2 t-esc="state.tab === 'activity' ? '活动与广告接口尚未接入' : '效果指标尚不可获取'"/><p t-esc="state.tab === 'activity' ? '当前没有已验证的活动资格、价格或广告资源接口，无法创建或执行此类操作。' : '当前没有平台生效记录及统计窗口数据。销量、访问、广告指标保持未知，不推断因果。'"/></section>
        <section t-elif="state.tab === 'audit'" class="mw-card"><div class="mw-card-heading"><h2>任务审计时间线</h2></div><div t-if="!state.detail.events.length" class="mw-empty">暂无审计事件</div><details class="mw-audit" t-foreach="state.detail.events" t-as="event" t-key="event.id"><summary><t t-esc="event.create_date"/> · <t t-esc="event.kind"/> · 任务 <t t-esc="event.task_id[0]"/></summary><pre t-esc="json(event.receipt)"/></details></section>
      </t>
      </t>
    </main>
  </div>
  <div t-if="state.modal" class="mw-modal-backdrop" t-on-keydown="modalKeydown"><section class="mw-modal mw-card" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="mw-dialog-title"><div class="mw-card-heading"><h2 id="mw-dialog-title" t-esc="state.modal === 'collection' ? '新建独立采集' : state.modal === 'library-select' ? '选择换装目标与源服装' : state.modal === 'library-detail' ? '图库来源与图片' : state.modal === 'task' ? '创建执行任务' : state.modal === 'preview' ? '确切变更预览' : state.modal === 'create' ? '新建商品优化' : '新增快照版本'"/><button class="mw-button" t-on-click="() => {state.modal='';}" aria-label="关闭对话框">×</button></div>
    <form t-if="state.modal === 'collection'" class="mw-form" t-on-submit.prevent="saveCollection">
      <label>采集名称<input t-model="state.form.name"/></label><label>源服装描述 *<input required="required" t-model="state.form.garment"/></label><label>源商品链接<input type="url" t-model="state.form.source_url"/></label><label>站点<input required="required" t-model="state.form.site_id"/></label><label>源服装参考图（可选）<input type="file" accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp" t-on-change="readGarment"/></label><p class="mw-note">链接仅作为来源记录，不会由服务器直接抓取。采集和研究需要具备能力的 Worker。</p><button class="mw-button primary" t-att-disabled="state.loading">创建独立采集任务</button>
    </form>
    <div t-elif="['library-select','library-detail'].includes(state.modal)" class="mw-library-dialog">
      <t t-if="state.modal === 'library-select'"><label>搜索参考商品<input t-model="state.libraryQuery"/></label><button class="mw-button" t-on-click="filterLibrary">筛选图库</button><div class="mw-actions"><button class="mw-button" t-foreach="state.library" t-as="entry" t-key="entry.id" t-on-click="() => this.chooseLibrary(entry)"><t t-esc="entry.name"/> · <t t-esc="entry.payload.images.length"/> 张</button></div></t>
      <t t-if="state.librarySelection"><h3 t-esc="state.librarySelection.name"/><p>SKU：<t t-esc="json(state.librarySelection.payload.selected_variant)"/> · 采集时间 <t t-esc="state.librarySelection.payload.observed_at"/></p><p>完整性：<t t-esc="state.librarySelection.payload.completeness_status"/> <t t-esc="state.librarySelection.payload.reason || ''"/></p><div class="mw-candidates"><article class="mw-candidate" t-foreach="state.librarySelection.payload.images" t-as="image" t-key="image.image_id"><div class="mw-candidate-image"><img t-att-src="libraryImage(image)" alt="图库目标图"/></div><strong t-esc="image.image_id"/><p><t t-esc="image.role"/> · <t t-esc="image.width"/> × <t t-esc="image.height"/></p><a t-if="safeUrl(image.source)" t-att-href="safeUrl(image.source)" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">原始来源 ↗</a><small t-esc="image.sha256"/><label t-if="state.modal === 'library-select'" class="mw-choice"><input type="checkbox" t-att-checked="state.libraryIndices.includes(image_index)" t-on-change="() => this.toggleLibrary(image_index)"/>选择为换装目标</label></article></div>
      <t t-if="state.modal === 'library-select'"><label>单独选择源服装参考图<select t-model="state.garmentArtifact"><option value="">选择当前商品服装图片</option><option t-foreach="garmentArtifacts" t-as="a" t-key="a.id" t-att-value="a.id">#<t t-esc="a.id"/> · <t t-esc="a.digest.slice(0,12)"/></option></select></label><label>上传源服装参考图<input type="file" accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp" t-on-change="uploadGarment"/></label><p class="mw-note">已选择 <strong t-esc="state.libraryIndices.length"/> 张目标图，将创建相同数量的逐图任务。只替换服装，保留人物、姿态、配饰、背景、光线和构图。外部生成能力未配置时任务等待，不会自动调用付费服务。</p><button class="mw-button primary" t-on-click="saveLibrarySelection" t-att-disabled="state.loading || !state.libraryIndices.length || !state.garmentArtifact">冻结计划并创建换装任务</button></t>
      <details><summary>不可变来源与采集证据</summary><pre t-esc="json(state.librarySelection)"/></details></t>
    </div>
    <form t-elif="['create','snapshot'].includes(state.modal)" t-on-submit.prevent="saveProduct" class="mw-form"><label t-foreach="['shop','item_id','title','site_id','seller_sku','available_quantity','image_url']" t-as="field" t-key="field"><span t-esc="({shop:'店铺名称 *',item_id:'商品 ID *',title:'原标题 *',site_id:'站点',seller_sku:'SKU',available_quantity:'库存（留空代表未知）',image_url:'商品图片 URL'})[field]"/><input t-model="state.form[field]" t-att-required="['shop','item_id','title'].includes(field)" t-att-type="field === 'available_quantity' ? 'number' : field === 'image_url' ? 'url' : 'text'" min="0" step="1"/></label><label t-if="state.modal === 'create'"><span>批次名称</span><input t-model="state.form.batch_name" placeholder="手动优化批次"/></label><p class="mw-note">手动快照不调用平台接口。请核实店铺、商品身份和 SKU。</p><button class="mw-button primary" t-att-disabled="state.loading">保存快照</button></form>
    <form t-elif="state.modal === 'task'" class="mw-form" t-on-submit.prevent="saveTask"><label>任务类型<select t-model="state.taskType"><option t-foreach="Object.keys(taskLabels)" t-as="kind" t-key="kind" t-att-value="kind" t-esc="taskLabels[kind]"/></select></label><label t-foreach="taskFields" t-as="field" t-key="field"><span t-esc="fieldLabel(field)"/><select t-if="isArtifact(field)" t-model="state.taskValues[field]" required="required"><option value="">选择当前商品已归档的产物</option><option t-foreach="state.detail.artifacts" t-as="artifact" t-key="artifact.id" t-att-value="artifact.id">#<t t-esc="artifact.id"/> · <t t-esc="artifact.mime_type || 'JSON'"/> · <t t-esc="artifact.digest.slice(0,12)"/><t t-if="artifact.result_task_id"> · 来源任务 #<t t-esc="artifact.result_task_id[0]"/></t></option></select><input t-else="" t-model="state.taskValues[field]" required="required" t-att-placeholder="field === 'selected_variant' ? '准确的 seller SKU' : ''"/></label><p class="mw-note">引用产物必须属于当前商品。外部研究 / 生成需要配置相应 Worker 能力；此界面不调用付费服务。</p><button class="mw-button primary" t-att-disabled="state.loading">加入执行队列</button></form>
    <div t-elif="state.modal === 'preview' and state.preview" class="mw-preview"><p>商品：<strong t-esc="state.preview.payload.scope"/> · 操作：<t t-esc="state.preview.payload.action"/></p><div class="mw-diff"><div><small>变更前</small><p t-esc="value(state.preview.payload.before_value)"/></div><div><small>确切目标值 / 顺序</small><p t-if="state.preview.payload.action === 'title'" t-esc="state.preview.payload.desired_value"/><div t-elif="state.preview.payload.action === 'reference'"><strong t-esc="state.preview.payload.desired_value.item_id"/><p t-esc="state.preview.payload.desired_value.selection_reason"/></div><ol t-else=""><li t-foreach="state.preview.payload.desired_value" t-as="image" t-key="image.image_id"><img t-if="imageUrl(image)" t-att-src="imageUrl(image)" alt="待确认图片" style="width:70px;height:80px;object-fit:contain"/><span t-esc="image.image_id"/> · <span t-esc="image.role"/></li></ol></div></div><details><summary>展开方案版本与审计证据</summary><pre t-esc="json(state.preview.payload)"/></details><p class="mw-note">确认摘要：<code t-esc="state.preview.digest"/></p><p class="mw-note">确认保存当前方案及输入版本；平台发布不可用。</p><button t-if="state.data.can_edit and state.preview.current !== false and !state.preview.confirmed" class="mw-button primary" t-on-click="confirm" t-att-disabled="state.loading">确认以上确切方案</button></div>
  </section></div>
</div>
</t>
<t t-name="meli_optimization.FactsResult">
  <div class="mw-facts-list">
    <article class="mw-fact" t-foreach="factsResult.facts" t-as="fact" t-key="fact_index">
      <h3 t-esc="fact.name"/>
      <dl><t t-foreach="fact.rows" t-as="row" t-key="row_index"><dt t-esc="row.path || '观察值'"/><dd t-esc="row.value"/></t></dl>
      <div class="mw-fact-evidence">
        <span t-if="!fact.evidence.length">来源与采集时间未提供</span>
        <div t-foreach="fact.evidence" t-as="evidence" t-key="evidence_index">
          <span>来源：<t t-esc="evidence.source"/> · 证据 <t t-esc="evidence.id"/></span>
          <span>采集时间（证据记录）：<t t-esc="evidence.observed_at"/></span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
  <div class="mw-facts-uncertainties"><h3>不确定项与适用范围</h3><ul t-if="factsResult.uncertainties.length"><li t-foreach="factsResult.uncertainties" t-as="uncertainty" t-key="uncertainty_index" t-esc="uncertainty"/></ul><p t-else="">结果未列出额外不确定项；不代表字段已获外部验证。</p></div>
</t>
</templates>
